From: bohdanmatveiev15 <bohdanmatveiev15@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:35:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add a simulation clock that moves only on work days

A simulation day is now a real date on which you work (sim start or
sim standup), not every calendar day since sim init. Days away do not
move the clock. The simulation calendar has only weekdays, and standup
prints both the simulation date and the real date, plus sprint hours.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BWgtHECrhxzXRWrHYBDq2Z
